        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="totals" parent="1" style="text;html=1;overflow=fill;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;4&quot; style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;height:100%;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;TDE totals&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Per 27U rack&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;40 racks&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;uTCA crates&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;320&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;25G data links (LC duplex)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;320&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Active data fibers&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;16&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;640&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;MTP8 breakouts, container to 27U panel&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;80&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;MTP12 data trunks to DAQ barracks (8 active + 4 dark)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;80&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;1G Ctrl ports on aggregating switch (RJ45 Cu)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;320&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;100G links, readout switch to server&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;80&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;TDE readout servers (4x100G inputs, 2 racks each)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1 per 2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;20&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;WR timing fibers, mezzanine to crates (SM, TDE-owned)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;320&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;WR switches on mezzanine (2 GM + 2 L2 + 20 L1)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;-&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;24&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;DTS-WR interface units / pulse generators / WR TDCs&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;-&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;2 each&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;SM timing fibers, DTS master to mezzanine&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;-&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;1G Ctrl ports on mezzanine for WR (24 switches + 2 TDC PCs)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;-&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;26+&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="90" y="1460" width="660" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Draft 2026-11-10&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sources: DAQ VD Fiber Plant v3; &amp;quot;VD onDetector Rack View of Cabling&amp;quot; (TMS, stamped 16SEPT2026); &amp;quot;VD Cryostat 27U Detector Racks&amp;quot; naming drawing (20 N + 20 S racks); &amp;quot;DTS to TDE White Rabbit Synchronisation Interface&amp;quot; (EDMS 3482906, draft v7.0, 26 Oct 2026).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Open items&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. The TMS cabling sheet shows 40GbE MTP-12F per crate (64 active fibers, 6-8 MTP12 per rack). The DAQ baseline drawn here is 25G on an LC pair per crate (16 active fibers, 2 MTP12 per rack); the sheet needs updating to match.&lt;br&gt;2. The WR interface document leaves the WR Grand Master / DTS interface location open (cryostat area or CUC). Drawn here on the detector mezzanine, with the DTS master in the DAQ barracks.&lt;br&gt;3. Which mezzanine racks host the WR switches, Grand Masters, DTS interface units and sync-check hardware.&lt;br&gt;4. L1 uplinks land on a Grand Master or its L2 M extension; the exact port map is not drawn.&lt;br&gt;5. Two 10G Ctrl uplinks per 27U rack are assumed.&lt;br&gt;6. Purchase ownership assumed, not confirmed: racks (FDC I&amp;amp;I); patch cord from the 1G switch to the 27U patch panel and the mezzanine Ctrl uplink (FDC I&amp;amp;I); 1G Cu management cables from WR hardware (TDE).&lt;br&gt;7. Follow-up: who purchases the 2xLC patch cord from the DAQ barracks patch panel to the Ctrl network switch (drawn as DAQ).&lt;br&gt;8. The patching between the trunk patch panel and the readout switches (top-of-rack patch panels, MTP-12 into 4-way breakout transceivers, per EDMS 3463072) is not drawn in detail." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="790" y="1460" width="960" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>